  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you pin your opponent, you take them to the ground.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Grapple or grab special attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you succeed at a grapple combat maneuver to pin a creature, you also knock that creature prone. You need not make a separate combat maneuver check to trip the target, and abilities such as stability that grant a bonus to CMD against trip maneuvers do not apply. As long as you remain stationary and adjacent to the target while maintaining the pin, you are no longer considered grappled.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
